## Module Architecture

### Barrel Exports (with caution)
```typescript
// components/ui/index.ts — barrel for public API
export { Button } from './Button';
export { Input } from './Input';
export { Card } from './Card';
export type { ButtonProps } from './Button';

// Import from barrel in consuming code
import { Button, Card } from '@/components/ui';

// CAUTION: barrels can cause circular dependencies — never barrel internals
```

### Module Cohesion
```typescript
// Keep related code together — feature folders, not type folders
// BAD: /types/post.ts, /utils/post.ts, /hooks/post.ts, /components/Post.tsx
// GOOD: /features/posts/types.ts, /features/posts/hooks.ts, /features/posts/Post.tsx
```

